{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G3-02","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區四岔路口，穿越來車是否容易察覺？","intro":"主要道路約 10 m、次要道路約 5 m，兩側無人行設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-02-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[0,0,3074.521,2321]},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"缺少交叉來車警示","text":"主次道路均缺少警示設施，駕駛不易預期橫向穿越車流。"},{"id":"lanes","title":"東西向車道配置不同","text":"次要道路東西兩側的車道及自行車空間配置不同，銜接需檢視。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限提示不足","text":"兩條道路皆缺少速限標字與標誌。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[59,60],"strategy":{"title":"以槽化提高鄉區路口辨識度","intro":"透過類滴狀島槽化、方向分隔與預告，讓駕駛提早察覺交叉口。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-02-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"channelization","title":"讓車輛看見路口範圍","text":"在主要道路接近路口處配置類滴狀島槽化，引導車輛循明確路徑通行。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"boundaries","title":"區分雙向車流與路肩","text":"以行車分向線及路面邊線界定車道，避免行駛範圍與路肩混淆。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"priority","title":"補齊停讓與岔路提示","text":"配合次要道路停讓管制與岔路標誌，提醒駕駛注意交叉來車。","moduleId":"M2-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-3-02-unsignalized-rural-orthogonal-cross.typ","sha256":"85e3e43a1e71438ef6fb714bb50c92517138ab8527350ee011a407cc2ae8fcfc","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g3-02-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-02/G3-02_現況圖_01.png","width":3446,"height":2321,"label":"G3-02 現況圖","scenario":"G3-02","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":59,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image58.png","sha256":"7e61cade63e38f1f57af6d0ec5743fe67669a410a3960282dd6f0f1f2cc67671"},"results:g3-02-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-02/G3-02_現況照片_01.png","width":1841,"height":943,"label":"G3-02 現況照片","scenario":"G3-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"so